      "role": "user",
      "content": "Got it. The edge network thing is manageable. What I'm more concerned about is the integrity of the scanning engines themselves. Have there been any issues with the reliability of the tool outputs lately? Like, can we 100% trust that what the scanners are reporting is the actual state of the environment, or is there any risk of telemetry being missed or masked?",
